Package: webformscore
Type: Package
Title: 'WebForms Core'
Version: 2.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Mohammad", family = "Rabie", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "info@elanat.net")
Description: A stateless server-driven user interface technology for building web interfaces through server-side user interface manipulation. 'WebForms Core' provides a common structure across multiple programming languages. The server-side class acts as a commander that generates commands, while 'WebFormsJS' serves as the client-side executor that applies them. Commands range from atomic operations, such as adding elements and modifying text and attributes, to higher-level operations such as iterative processing and render. See <https://github.com/webforms-core>.
